app "wildkin" {
  // A monster-taming RPG in pixel art. Walk six areas by tapping where to go; wild kin hide in the
  // tall grass. Battles are turn by turn: four moves each, seven elements that beat one another,
  // tonics and charms from the bag, and a charm thrown at a worn-down kin makes it yours. Kin grow,
  // learn moves and evolve. Four keepers each hold a sigil; the gates north open to two and four,
  // and the Elder waits on Stormridge.
  //
  // There's no game loop: a turn resolves at once, in `on bGo`, and leaves timed events (`evs`, in
  // seconds from the turn's start) that the battle canvas plays from `fxAt`. A walk works the same
  // way: the path is laid down at the tap and the hero is drawn along it.

  meta { owl: 14; description: "A monster-taming RPG in pixel art: catch wild kin in the tall grass, train them in turn-based battles, evolve them, and beat four keepers and the Elder"; version: "1.0.0"; license: "MIT"; category: "games" }

  title: ""
  statusBar: false
  edge: true
